<section aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <h2 id="about-heading">What is it and why it was built</h2>
  <p>
    desktop‑2fa is an offline TOTP authenticator for people who want their second factor to
    live in a local encrypted vault. There is no cloud sync or account-based service.
  </p>
  <p>
    Version 0.11.0 brings complete account and vault workflows to the Textual terminal
    interface, alongside the full CLI. Both use the same local encrypted vault.
  </p>
  <p>
    It does not replace hardware tokens or protect a compromised device. Review the{' '}<a href="/docs/security">security model</a> to understand its limits.
  </p>
</section>